ollowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":13,"state":"closed","created_at":"2022-09-22T21:29:08Z","updated_at":"2022-11-17T19:11:45Z","due_on":"2022-11-16T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2022-11-17T19:11:45Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2022-10-06T08:46:02Z","updated_at":"2022-11-17T16:06:12Z","closed_at":"2022-10-17T07:58:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Command\r\n\r\nadd\r\n\r\n### Is this a regression?\r\n\r\n- [X] Yes, this behavior used to work in the previous version\r\n\r\n### The previous version in which this bug was not present was\r\n\r\n14.2.5\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nAngular v15.0.0-next.5 contains the fix from @alan-agius4 to properly add the `@angular/localize` polyfill in a CLI app now that the `polyfills.ts` file is gone. https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/400a6b5e3707f3939d84c659a115b75ef15d2c09\r\n\r\nThe polyfill is added when running `ng add`, but it looks like using `$localize` still doesn't work.\r\n\r\n```\r\nError: src/app/app.component.ts:9:11 - error TS2304: Cannot find name '$localize'.\r\n\r\n9   title = $localize`i18n-next`;\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Minimal Reproduction\r\n\r\n```\r\nnpx @angular/cli@15.0.0-next.4 new i18n-next --defaults\r\ncd i18n-next\r\nnpm i\r\nng add @angular/localize@15.0.0-next.5 --skip-confirmation\r\n```\r\n\r\nthen update `app.component.ts` with:\r\n```ts\r\ntitle = $localize`i18n-next`;\r\n```\r\n\r\nand run:\r\n```\r\nng extract-i18n --output-path src/locale/\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe same repro using the stable release of the CLI and fwk works out of the box.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Exception or Error\r\n\r\n```text\r\nError: src/app/app.component.ts:9:11 - error TS2304: Cannot find name '$localize'.\r\n\r\n9   title = $localize`i18n-next`;\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Your Environment\r\n\r\n```text\r\nAngular CLI: 15.0.0-next.4\r\nNode: 16.17.0\r\nPackage Manager: npm 6.14.17\r\nOS: darwin arm64\r\n\r\nAngular: 15.0.0-next.5\r\n... animations, common, compiler, compiler-cli, core, forms\r\n... localize, platform-browser, platform-browser-dynamic, router\r\n\r\nPackage                         Version\r\n---------------------------------------------------------\r\n@angular-devkit/architect       0.1500.0-next.4\r\n@angular-devkit/build-angular   15.0.0-next.4\r\n@angular-devkit/core            15.0.0-next.4\r\n@angular-devkit/schematics      15.0.0-next.4\r\n@angular/cli                    15.0.0-next.4\r\n@schematics/angular             15.0.0-next.4\r\nrxjs                            7.5.7\r\ntypescript                      4.7.4\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Anything else relevant?\r\n\r\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"dylhunn","id":7135246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzUyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7135246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn","html_url":"https://github.com/dylhunn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dy